    "detailed_description": "Into the Depths of Despair (ItDod)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI woke up in a room, but I was never asleep. The air is heavy, carrying a scent I can\u2019t recognize. I see with eyes that are not my own, feel a body that doesn\u2019t feel like mine.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe walls seem to breathe, the shadows shift when I\u2019m not looking. There\u2019s no sound except my own breathing\u2014I am alone. Or am I?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomething is keeping me here. I don\u2019t remember how I got to this place, but I know there must be a reason. Is there a way out? Or am I sinking deeper into despair?",
